{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/gif_5.gif?t=1745121062\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Chaos Fingerprint</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Physics-based interactions allow for hundreds of unique explosions and cinematic fatalities.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/gif2.gif?t=1745121062\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dead Aim </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use precision targeting to disable vital components and cripple the opposition.</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/gif1.gif?t=1745121062\" />  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Meaningful Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vehicles and drivers have unique Active and Passive abilities that fundamentally alter the game. The vehicles of the police force can grapple-hook enemies towards them and rip their parts off, followed by lethal and non-lethal passive abilities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/gif-4.gif?t=1745121062\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dynamic Foliage and Seasons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your vehicle interacts with the foliage in the environment. Seasonal changes can impact vehicle performance, reduce weapon overheating, and reveal areas of the world that would otherwise be inaccessible.\u00a0\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/gif3.gif?t=1745121062\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>*With GPU and CPU performance in mind, precalculated physics interactions adaptively reduce your gaming device's real-time hardware demand.</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete in 5-minute deathmatches that culminate in a challenging boss-fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/gif---boss-fight.gif?t=1745121062\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Deep Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock, equip, and upgrade components to enhance vehicle performance. Obtain powerful vehicle and weapon augments hidden throughout the battlefield.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/gif6.gif?t=1745121062\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Apply skins, paints, and decals to make it yours.\u00a0More importantly:\u00a0Stay Metal\u00a0\ud83e\udd18\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Procedural Awareness\u00a0(TBA)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A character's synchronization with their vehicle varies based on perceived sense of safety and your ability to handle the machine. Drive the machine, but don't let the machine drive you. The madness is always looming...</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Twisted Story\u00a0(TBA)</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Campaign Mode\u00a0(TBA)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>FAQ</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Will this be released for consoles?</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> PC, PS5, and Xbox. Steam Deck and VR are unconfirmed at this time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>When can I try it?</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Opt-in on the store page to playtest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Will it have gamepad and wheel support?</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yes and yes. However, early builds of the playtest may not have full controller support.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Linux, MacOS, Steam Deck, Switch?</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To be confirmed.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3068230?t=1745121062","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/97a3f2242b02163ffbc2822a6cf101d61c90398f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745121062","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/380651e1cdb4eeef42718bbc669b49f128712d9c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745121062","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/380651e1cdb4eeef42718bbc669b49f128712d9c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745121062","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/gif_5.gif?t=1745121062\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Chaos Fingerprint</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Physics-based interactions allow for hundreds of unique explosions and cinematic fatalities.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/gif2.gif?t=1745121062\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dead Aim </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use precision targeting to disable vital components and cripple the opposition.</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/gif1.gif?t=1745121062\" />  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Meaningful Abilities</strong></h2><p 